  "content": "\n\n<p>覺得建造苦力怕農場很棘手嗎？你更偏好冒險玩法嗎？</p>\n<p>這個模組就是為你打造的！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這個模組新增了火藥的製作配方 :)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎瀏覽我的其他模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewing-stand-mk-ii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">煉藥台 Mk.II</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/remote-control-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遙控卡</a>&nbsp;（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-of-thunder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雷電藥水</a>&nbsp;（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sunny-wand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">晴天法杖</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-compressor-0-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊壓縮機</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-ultra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TNT Ultra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-planting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自動種植</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/signal-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">訊號方塊</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-display\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品欄顯示</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-netherstar-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易下界之星配方</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allien-fusion-generator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">外星融合發電機</a>&nbsp;（適用於 Mekanism 等）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-netherite-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易下界合金 Plus</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>",
